### Register (201). Copy accessToken into http-client.env.json as "token".
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@example.com", "password": "Passw0rdOk", "displayName": "Budi", "deviceName": "dev" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@example.com", "password": "Passw0rdOk", "deviceName": "dev" }

### Refresh (rotates the refresh token; the old one stops working)
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "paste refreshToken" }

### Logout this device -> 204
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "paste refreshToken" }

### Me
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update me
PATCH {{host}}/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "displayName": "Budi S", "defaultCurrency": "IDR" }
